Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Second Episode\NA New King\NThe Coronation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I put my mind to it, I can do it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.90,0:02:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Until now, I've been weak and cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.27,0:02:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I have courage too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Uranari, tonight is the night—I have made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I will make an announcement that will shock everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, look forward to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But Your Majesty, that... what on earth is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.21,0:02:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.47,0:02:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Doctor, please leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,As of today, I am changing the law of Silverland
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.61,0:03:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,that forbids women from taking the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of the King, I hereby decree
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,that a woman may become Queen and rule this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.14,0:03:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.74,0:03:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting with this, I will change all the bad laws one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take much more of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.88,0:04:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The King is missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't been seen anywhere since this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.67,0:04:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're frantically searching everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.98,0:04:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.48,0:04:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Search every nook and cranny again—once, twice, three times!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.95,0:04:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thoroughly, search thoroughly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.73,0:04:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.61,0:04:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.47,0:04:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We searched the castle from top to bottom, but he's nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Check inside the moat, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My Queen, the King was up writing something alone all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.15,0:05:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, if something happened to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go search again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The family must be so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, for the King to just vanish is truly bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your mouth shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.91,0:05:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall search as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Command us as you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not in here, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.81,0:05:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in the ancestral tombs... but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.00,0:06:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.34,0:06:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.19,0:06:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it just my imagination?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.33,0:06:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My Prince, someone spotted a figure resembling the King early this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Over by the Northern Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll go check!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, head to the Northern Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Father's shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, hold the end of this rope in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.17,0:07:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,OPAL!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Father's shoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My deepest condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.72,0:08:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,one week after the King's passing, the Prince will succeed to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.35,0:09:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire's coronation, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If our scheme goes smoothly by then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it should be quite an interesting coronation!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool, Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.52,0:10:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.03,0:10:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You look beautiful, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.49,0:10:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought I was crying, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.41,0:10:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I came to comfort you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to cry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of crying, I decided to dress up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the last time I'll ever get to dress up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I become King, I'll never be able to wear clothes like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So you decided to wear them one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanny, were you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.70,0:10:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was helping her get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.96,0:11:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I not cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.98,0:11:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, this will certainly not be the last time you dress up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you ascend to the throne, you can change those old laws right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So that anyone can become King.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a new step so a woman can become queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, that's what I'll do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:24.60,Karaoke - 22 the coronation 1,,0,0,0,,{\k26}Da{\k26}i {\k36}ka{\k15}n{\k29}ki
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:24.60,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Great joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:26.56,Karaoke - 22 the coronation 1,,0,0,0,,{\k19}Da{\k25}i {\k32}ka{\k21}n{\k33}ki
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:26.56,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Great joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:30.96,Karaoke - 22 the coronation 1,,0,0,0,,{\k23}U{\k26}re{\k54}shi {\k28}u{\k25}re{\k49}shi {\k15}da{\k25}i {\k42}ka{\k22}n{\k70}ki
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:30.96,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy! I'm overjoyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.06,0:11:33.12,Karaoke - 22 the coronation 1,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k23}Lu {\k42}lu {\k32}lu,{\k11} {\k18}lu {\k47}lu {\k33}lu {\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.25,0:11:36.68,Karaoke - 22 the coronation 1,,0,0,0,,{\k47}U{\k50}re{\k44}shi{\k53} {\k33}da{\k28}i {\k24}ka{\k21}n{\k43}ki
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.25,0:11:36.68,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Oh, happy, great joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.55,Karaoke - 22 the coronation 1,,0,0,0,,{\k25}O {\k37}shi{\k42}ro {\k21}pi{\k25}ka{\k25}pi{\k25}ka{\k25}pi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.55,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The castle is sparkling bright!
