Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.66,0:25:06.47,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.47,0:25:09.77,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k11}{\k47}Rib{\k27}bon {\k25}de {\k33}tsu{\k22}na{\k13}go{\k23}u {\k19}i{\k30}chi{\k19}o{\k7}ku{\k54}-nen
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.47,0:25:09.77,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!
